## 1. Sensitivity: SUPPORTED on the real effects
  a valid metric and |Δ*| >= SESOI: SUPPORTED 118/121 = 97.5% (95% CI 92.9-99.5%)
  a valid metric, any Δ*:          SUPPORTED 185/206 = 89.8% (95% CI 84.8-93.6%)
  the outcomes of the main cell: SUPPORTED 118; INCONCLUSIVE 1; NOT SUPPORTED: metric invalid (GATE 4/5) 2
  by condition and variant (main cell):
    E1 dose=key   SUPPORTED 54/54 = 100.0% (95% CI 93.4-100.0%)
    E1 dose=0.5   SUPPORTED 13/13 = 100.0% (95% CI 75.3-100.0%)
    E1 dose=1.5   SUPPORTED 21/22 = 95.5% (95% CI 77.2-99.9%)
    E2 against    SUPPORTED 11/12 = 91.7% (95% CI 61.5-99.8%)
    E3 with       SUPPORTED 19/20 = 95.0% (95% CI 75.1-99.9%)
  design effect of the main cell: donors 1.00, pair 1.00, both 1.00
  its 121 cards share 3 gene pairs

(the design effects below through M'M: on 68 cell and unit choices of up to 1,500 cards they
equal score.overlap_interval's within a relative 8.3e-15)

